    <string name="ai_guide_open_demo">Open AI Watchface demo</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_open_demo_hint">Set DeviceId &amp; size → start AiCenter → use AI watchface on the watch.</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_overview_title">Overview</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_overview_body">Entry: com.huawo.ai.AiCenter\nSupports AI watchface, Q&amp;A, meeting, health analysis, and related BLE + cloud flows.</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_deps_title">1. Dependencies</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_deps_body">Put in app/libs: ai-*.aar, BluetoothSDK-*.aar, qjs-watchface-*.aar, QW_release_*.aar, BmpConvert_*.aar, jl_pack_resource_*.aar.\nGradle: implementation fileTree(dir: \'libs\', include: [\'*.aar\'])\nAlso need okhttp / gson / lifecycle-process and matching Sifli AARs.</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_perm_title">2. Permissions</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_perm_body">This demo uses the watch mic only — no RECORD_AUDIO and no foreground mic service.\nNeed INTERNET and BLE permissions (Android 12+: BLUETOOTH_SCAN / CONNECT).</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_steps_title">3. Integration steps</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_steps_body">1) Application: AiCenter.setApplication(app)\n2) Connect watch via BluetoothSDK\n3) init(ctx, false) → setAiEvent → setCallback → setKeyAndSecret → setRecordFromDevice(true) → startWorking\n4) setDeviceInfo(AiDeviceInfo) — required (missing → 80051)\n5) Exit: stopWorking() / destroy()\nSync foreground: setAppInForeground(true/false)\nDo not call startRecordService() when using the device mic.</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_device_title">4. AiDeviceInfo</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_device_body">Set mac, type, id (AFlash DeviceId, not MAC), width/height/corner, thumbnail size, locale.\nPanel size must match the real watch. Call again after reconnect or locale/size change.</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_events_title">5. AiEvent (main)</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_events_body">Entered/exited AI watchface or Q&amp;A\nStart/stop recording (type: 0 watchface, 1 Q&amp;A…)\nImage / preview callbacks\nWatchface OTA done\nQ&amp;A text / TTS voice\nPost UI updates on the main thread</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_errors_title">6. Common errors</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_errors_body">80051 — device info not set\n80021 / 80023 / 80024 — image download / scale / bin failed\n80027 — QJS build failed\n80401 / 40002 — auth failed (key/secret / DeviceId / network)\n10416 / 10516 — daily limit</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_demo_title">7. Try in this demo</string>
    <string name="ai_guide_card_demo_body">Connect on Home → open the demo below → fill DeviceId &amp; size → Apply → start AI watchface on the watch → check images and logs.</string>
